+// Patch 0225 (gs_frontend.cpp). A/B mode 187 (ps2spin::kAbPauseCount, below): the spin waits of
+// the GS GIF thread and of the IOP hand-off count pauses again instead of lasting a time, and the GIF packets are
+// published with a full barrier each, as before patch 0225. ps2GsGifStatsText: for the 10 s "[gs:gpu]" and
+// "[gs:hilo]" lines, by mode (patch 0225 and A/B 187), the time the GS GIF worker ran, how much of it it slept, its
